[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12900.67, "timestamp": "03:35:00", "text": "网络肯定瘫痪了。不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12904.87, "timestamp": "03:35:04", "text": "维克·里克。不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12912.15, "timestamp": "03:35:12", "text": "不，哦，不。哦，什么？发生了什么事？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12914.07, "timestamp": "03:35:14", "text": "呃，维克，我觉得你的网络断了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12922.389, "timestamp": "03:35:22", "text": "没关系。哦，谢谢你的饮料。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12924.229, "timestamp": "03:35:24", "text": "我马上就去做。你们应该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12927.03, "timestamp": "03:35:27", "text": "还要喝水。是的。是的。谢谢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12931.71, "timestamp": "03:35:31", "text": "提醒你一下，那可不是件坏事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12935.75, "timestamp": "03:35:35", "text": "乐趣。好的。好的。总之，呃，乔，我想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12939.269, "timestamp": "03:35:39", "text": "你掌握了一些基础知识。是的。基本思路。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12952.07, "timestamp": "03:35:52", "text": "一旦我适应了，就不会了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12955.91, "timestamp": "03:35:55", "text": "可怕的。我希望如此。是的。是的。一般来说，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12957.67, "timestamp": "03:35:57", "text": "这个游戏，这个游戏，其实不是那样。"}]